<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ordinary OMR Checker - Google Sheets Portal</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 24px;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .header-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E293B 100%);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25);
        }

        .badge-lite {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #10B981;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .form-label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #334155;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .input-text {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .input-text:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #2563EB;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.05s ease;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #2563EB;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #1D4ED8;
        }

        .btn-success {
            background: #059669;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-success:hover {
            background: #047857;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: #64748B;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: #475569;
        }

        .action-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .action-card {
            background: #F8FAFC;
            border: 2px dashed #CBD5E1;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .action-card:hover {
            border-color: #2563EB;
            background: #EFF6FF;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .action-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: #1E293B;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .action-card p {
            color: #64748B;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 0 0 16px 0;
        }

        .info-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: #F1F5F9;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #475569;
            margin-right: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .script-box {
            background: #0F172A;
            color: #E2E8F0;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            max-height: 250px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            position: relative;
        }

        .copy-btn {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            right: 10px;
            background: #334155;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: none;
            font-size: 11px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .copy-btn:hover {
            background: #475569;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header-box">
            <span class="badge-lite">Ordinary OMR Checker</span>
            <h1 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 26px;">Google Sheets OMR Evaluation Portal</h1>
            <p style="margin: 0; color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
                Zero database footprint: paper and answer key are loaded directly from your Google Sheet.
                Scanned student marks and section totals are appended to the sheet automatically without storing photos on Cloudinary.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Google Sheet URL Setup Form -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 18px; color: #1E293B;">1. Connect Google Sheet</h2>
            <form action="/ordinary/setup" method="POST">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label" for="sheetUrl">Google Apps Script Web App URL or Google Spreadsheet Link:</label>
                    <input type="url" id="sheetUrl" name="sheetUrl" class="input-text"
                        placeholder="https://script.google.com/macros/s/.../exec"
                        value="<%= config.url || '' %>" required>
                    <small style="color: #64748B; font-size: 12px; display: block; margin-top: 6px;">
                        Paste the Web App URL from your Google Sheet's Apps Script deployment, or a public viewable Sheet link.
                    </small>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center;">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
                        <span>Save &amp; Load Paper</span>
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="document.getElementById('instructionsModal').style.display = 'block';">
                        <span>📋 View Apps Script Code</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>

        <!-- Active Paper Details -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; color: #1E293B;">2. Current Paper Details</h2>
            <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
                <span class="info-pill"><strong>Title:</strong> <%= config.title %></span>
                <span class="info-pill"><strong>Total Questions:</strong> <%= config.totalQuestions %></span>
                <span class="info-pill"><strong>Key Loaded:</strong> <%= Object.keys(config.answerKey || {}).length %> Questions</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Sections summary -->
            <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <strong style="font-size: 13px; color: #334155; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">Paper Sections:</strong>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
                    <% (config.sections || []).forEach(function(sec) { %>
                        <span class="info-pill" style="background: #EFF6FF; border: 1px solid #BFDBFE; color: #1D4ED8;">
                            <strong><%= sec.name %>:</strong> Q<%= sec.from %>-Q<%= sec.to %>
                        </span>
                    <% }); %>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action buttons to launch scanner or evaluator -->
            <h2 style="margin: 24px 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; color: #1E293B;">3. Start Checking</h2>
            <div class="action-grid">
                <div class="action-card">
                    <h3>📷 Live Camera Scanner</h3>
                    <p>Scan OMR sheets live via webcam or phone camera. Enter student name and save directly to Google Sheets.</p>
                    <a href="/ordinary/scanner" class="btn btn-success" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;">
                        Launch Camera Scanner
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="action-card">
                    <h3>📁 Image File Evaluator</h3>
                    <p>Upload or drag-and-drop captured OMR sheet images. Enter student name and save results instantly.</p>
                    <a href="/ordinary/evaluator" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;">
                        Launch File Evaluator
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Copy-Paste Apps Script Modal -->
        <div id="instructionsModal" style="display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); z-index: 1000; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px;">
            <div style="background: #fff; max-width: 750px; margin: 40px auto; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; max-height: 85vh; overflow-y: auto;">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                    <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #0F172A;">Google Apps Script Setup Code</h3>
                    <button onclick="document.getElementById('instructionsModal').style.display = 'none';" style="border: none; background: transparent; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                    1. In your Google Sheet, create an <strong>AnswerKey</strong> tab with columns: <code>Question | Answer | Section</code>.<br>
                    2. Go to <strong>Extensions &gt; Apps Script</strong> and paste the code below.<br>
                    3. Click <strong>Deploy &gt; New deployment &gt; Web app</strong> (Who has access: <em>Anyone</em>).<br>
                    4. Copy the Web App URL and paste it into the field above!
                </p>
                <div class="script-box">
                    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('rawScript').textContent); this.textContent = 'Copied!'; setTimeout(() => this.textContent = 'Copy', 2000);">Copy</button>
                    <pre id="rawScript" style="margin: 0; white-space: pre-wrap;"><%= appsScriptCode %></pre>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 16px;">
                    <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="document.getElementById('instructionsModal').style.display = 'none';">Close</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
